      "extract": "We have discussed how classical algorithms based on cluster expansion methods apply to quantum spin systems at high temperature. Our focus has been on conveying the simplicity of the method, which has appeared previously in other forms.1,2 We note that it may be possible to use the Markov chain polymer approach of Ref. 25 to obtain an algorithm with an improved runtime. For discrete classical spin systems, expansion",
